# lfg-web env. Copy to web/.env.local (gitignored) for local overrides.
#
# The web app needs no required env vars. Runtime UI extensions are loaded by
# the server (see LFG_EXTENSIONS in the repo-root .env.example), not the client.

# Optional: Umami analytics for the embedded onboarding survey (see
# src/lib/umami.ts). This repo does not own a Umami account, so neither var
# has a default — leave both unset and every trackEvent() call is a no-op
# (no script tag, no network call). Set both to turn tracking on.
# VITE_UMAMI_SRC=https://umami.example/script.js
# VITE_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=
